<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Culture Ontology (aka Culture Dataspace (DRK) Ontology) is designed in the Datenraum Kultur (DRK) project for the Culture Dataspace, providing extensible semantic concepts, properties, and their interrelationships for modeling metadata related to theaters, theatrical productions, and their showtimes."@en .
