<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/animalPolicy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that is used to describe the policies of a place concerning bringing animals along."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/animalPolicy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
