<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasAccessibilityFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that is used to describe the physical (and sometimes human-rated) accessibility of a physical place."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasAccessibilityFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasAccessibilityFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has Accessibility Feature Property"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalEvent
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/TheaterOrganization> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/TheatricalEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that links a theater organization to a theatrical event associated with that organization."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has Theatrical Event"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalProduction
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalProduction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/TheaterOrganization> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/TheatricalProduction> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that links a theater organization to a theatrical production associated with that organization."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/hasTheatricalProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has Theatrical Production"@en .
