<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/subtitleLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/TheatricalEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/subtitleLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://schema.org/Language> .
