<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/subtitleLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that specifies the languages in which subtitles or captions are available during a Theatrical Event."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/subtitleLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/subtitleLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Subtitle Language"@en .
# 
