<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/theatricalGenre> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/theatricalGenre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://schema.org/genre> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/theatricalGenre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/TheatricalProduction> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/theatricalGenre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/theatricalGenre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that specifies the theatrical genre of a theatrical production."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/theatricalGenre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
