<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairPlacesCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/WheelchairPlaces> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairPlacesCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairPlacesCount> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://sozialhelden.github.io/a11yjson/describing-objects/0-model/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairPlacesCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that specifies the number of designated places for wheelchairs, for example, in a theater place or a cinema hall."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairPlacesCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairPlacesCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wheelchair Places Count Property"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/WheelchairPlaces> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://sozialhelden.github.io/a11yjson/describing-objects/0-model/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property that specifies the number of people using a wheelchair that can be accommodated at the same time. This property should be used when there is no designated space for wheelchair users, but the number is known."@en .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/wheelchairUserCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wheelchair User Capacity Property"@en .
