<https://w3id.org/drk/ontology/TheatricalProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A class that includes all stages of Theatrical Production (including Play Production) from writing, planning, casting, and staging to rehearsal, but excludes the final presentation or performance, which is modeled as an Event using the drk:TheatricalEvent class."@en .
